-*   **Uniforms:** Three $4 \times 4$ transformation matrices: `modelToWorldMatrix`, `worldToCameraMatrix`, and `cameraToClipMatrix`. Alternatively, a pre-multiplied MVP matrix can be used [S1, unofficial].
